#: ../../index.rst:1
msgid "Guidedog Manual"
msgstr "Guidedog マニュアル"

#: ../../index.rst:4
msgid "**Write once. Explain well. Publish on the web and on paper.**"
msgstr "**一度書き、分かりやすく説明し、ウェブと紙に届ける。**"

#: ../../index.rst:6
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Guidedog is a documentation generator that builds HTML websites and "
#| "PDF books from reStructuredText and Markdown sources. It operates as a "
#| "self-contained executable without requiring a Python environment or "
#| "external LaTeX installation. The conversion engine is called "
#| "**Guidedoc**; PDF pages are typeset using Typst, and the documentation "
#| "website is generated directly."
msgid ""
"Guidedog is a documentation generator. It builds HTML websites and PDF "
"books from reStructuredText and Markdown sources. It is one "
"self-contained program, written in Rust. It needs no Python environment "
"and no LaTeX installation. The conversion engine is called **Guidedoc**. "
"The embedded Typst compiler typesets the PDF pages, and Guidedog writes "
"the website directly."
msgstr ""
"Guidedog は reStructuredText と Markdown のソースから HTML サイトと PDF "
"の本を作る文書生成ツールです。Python 環境や外部の LaTeX は不要です。変換エンジンは **Guidedoc** と呼ばれ、PDF "
"の組版には Typst を使います。サイトは Guidedog が直接生成します。"

#: ../../index.rst:12
msgid ""
"A small project needs three things: a source document, a table of "
"contents, and ``conf.toml``. Start with :doc:`tutorial/first-project`. "
"For a particular task, use :doc:`howto/index`. For an exact contract, use "
":doc:`reference/index`."
msgstr ""
"小さなプロジェクトに必要なのは、ソース文書、目次、\\ ``conf.toml`` の 3 つです。\\ "
":doc:`tutorial/first-project` から始めてください。作業別の手順は :doc:`howto/index`\\ "
"、正確な規約は :doc:`reference/index` にあります。"

#: ../../index.rst:19
msgid ""
"RST and Markdown enter Guidedoc; HTML goes to a browser and Typst "
"produces PDF."
msgstr "RST と Markdown を Guidedoc が読み、HTML はブラウザーへ、Typst は PDF を生成する。"

#: ../../index.rst:19
msgid "One source project, two publications."
msgstr "1 つのソースプロジェクトから、2 つの出版形式へ。"

